<title>UK: LIFFE to list Alliance &amp; Leicester options.</title>
<headline>LIFFE to list Alliance &amp; Leicester options.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London International Financial Futures &amp; Options Exchange (LIFFE) said it intends to make available equity options on shares of Alliance &amp; Leicester plc on the first day of public trading of the underlying stock.</p>
<p>This follows Alliance &amp; Leicester's announcement that it expects its shares to commence trading on the London Stock Exchange on April 21 as it converts from building society status to that of a bank.</p>
<p>The introduction of these options will increase the number of individual equity options at LIFFE to 72.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
